" ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," is more effective at increasing the critical damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Rune_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:rune-sword"}," ",{"t":"Rune Sword","r":"weapon:rune-sword"}," compared to the other relevant pickups."]},{"c":["Some ways of increasing or scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"}," are recommended in order to maximize the chance of landing a critical hit. ",{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," is the most powerful of these, as it continuously scales Luck throughout the entire game while also providing other benefits."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Not only will Reinhardt increase the damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Cavendish.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cavendish"}," ",{"t":"Cavendish","r":"weapon:cavendish"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"},", but his synergy with critical hits also benefits from the double crit chance this weapon provides."]}]}},{"c":["Reinhardt can output some of the highest numbers with the ",{"i":"Sprite-Stamazza.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:stamazza"}," ",{"t":"Stamazza","r":"weapon:stamazza"},", and can start with ",{"i":"Sprite-Mace.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:mace"}," ",{"t":"Mace","r":"weapon:mace"}," if the Spectral Sword starting weapon is selected, which can be useful if one wants to do a limited-slots run with Stamazza and ",{"i":"Sprite-Silent_Old_Sanctuary_(XX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"}," ",{"t":"Silent Old Sanctuary (XX)","r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Reinhardt_Schneider.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Reinhardt S